    "sentence_translations": [
      "Powdered Milk Money",
      "",
      "Nowadays a lot of young people say: “I must work hard to earn powdered milk money.”",
      "Perhaps you will ask: “Is powdered milk very expensive in China?”",
      "",
      "Indeed, the literal meaning of “powdered milk money” is just “money to buy powdered milk”.",
      "But nowadays the term powdered milk money includes all the expenses from birth until the child is one year old.",
      "Now you have to spend a lot of money to raise a child, and just powdered milk for a month costs over 2000 yuan.",
      "This is a considerable sum for low income households.",
      "",
      "So in China, you can often hear conversations like these:",
      "“I haven't saved up any powdered milk money, so I dare not have a child”",
      "“I even have to work on weekends to earn powdered milk money. There's nothing to do about it.”"
    ]
  }
